# Compiled artifacts of the C assembler. Regenerate with: cd mac-c && make
# EVERYTHING generated now lands in mac-c/build/ - objects and both
# executables (mac, test_mac). `make clean` removes the whole directory.
mac-c/build/


# Build/ binaries ARE tracked (see Build/README.md). Only the working files
# of a build and the disposable bring-up disc set are ignored.
Build/bringup/
Build/TSS?.SYMB
Build/*/TSS?.SYMB
Build/*/build.err
Build/*/build.out
Build/err_*.txt
Build/write_*.txt
